From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3: set the panel
 rotation

The panel scans out in portrait (1600x2560), while the tablet is used in
landscape with its keyboard cover, the panel's right side up. Describe
this with "rotation = <90>" (counter-clockwise, panel-common.yaml), which
the panel driver reports as DRM_MODE_PANEL_ORIENTATION_RIGHT_UP.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
index 8f29b189b3..879ade4fe8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
@@ -904,6 +904,8 @@ panel: panel@0 {
 		panel-id-gpios = <&tlmm 102 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>,
 				 <&tlmm 91 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 
+		rotation = <90>;
+
 		vddi-supply = <&vreg_l2b>;
 		avdd-supply = <&vreg_avdd_5p5>;
 		avee-supply = <&vreg_avee_5p5>;
